---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
import VideoCard from '../components/VideoCard.astro'

const PLACEHOLDER_VIDEO = 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WcXgQ'
const meetVideos = [
  { title: 'Meet Shane & Maud - Our Story', youtubeUrl: PLACEHOLDER_VIDEO, description: 'How we started, who we are, and what we care about.', category: 'getting-started' },
  { title: 'Showroom Walkthrough Tour', youtubeUrl: PLACEHOLDER_VIDEO, description: 'A walk through what\'s on the lot right now - new and used.', category: 'getting-started' },
]
---

<Site
  title="About SEQ Campers"
  description="SEQ Campers - Shane and Maud's Sunshine Coast off-road camper business. Three decades on the lot. Authorised Kimberley Kampers and Stockman dealer."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Off-road experts. Sunshine Coast.</h1>
      <p>Thirty years selling, servicing, and testing off-road campers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Meet the team -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 36px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Meet the team</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Shane and Maud</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">
          The husband-and-wife team behind SEQ Campers since 1996.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/2A1608/F4EDE0/png?text=Shane%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Shane - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Shane</div>
            <div class="team-role">Owner · SEQ Campers since 2013</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Shane has called SEQ Campers home since 2013 and has been the proud owner since 2019.
              His deep love of the outdoors, combined with a hands-on mechanical background, means he
              connects with customers not just as a businessman, but as a fellow adventurer who
              understands exactly what you need out on the road. There's nothing he enjoys more than
              helping someone find their perfect home on wheels and sending them off on their next
              big Queensland adventure.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/C0341A/F4EDE0/png?text=Maud%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Maud - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Maud</div>
            <div class="team-role">Co-owner · Customer Care · Operations</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Maud joined Shane in running the business in 2019, bringing warmth, a sharp business mind,
              and a genuine passion for ethical, people-first service. She believes that finding the right
              rig should be an exciting and stress-free experience, and she works hard to make sure every
              customer feels like part of the SEQ Campers family. For Maud, the best part of the job is
              knowing that what they do helps people get outside and make the most of this beautiful country.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:18px; font-style:italic;">
        Real headshots coming soon - Shane and Maud to send through photos.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <div class="rich-text">
        <h2>Our story: thirty years of off-road</h2>
        <p>
          We started this business in 1996 because we loved getting out into the bush
          and we got sick of gear that couldn't keep up. Shane had spent years on the
          tools - building, modifying, fixing - and Maud could talk to anyone, anywhere,
          about anything. We figured if we put those two things together and only sold
          rigs we'd actually take camping ourselves, we'd be alright.
        </p>
        <p>
          Three decades on, that's still the rule.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          "If Shane wouldn't take it on a trip, it doesn't go on the floor."
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          We've built relationships with the two manufacturers we trust most -
          <strong>Kimberley Kampers</strong> and <strong>Stockman Products</strong> -
          and we've stuck with them because they build the way we want things built.
          Tough, lightweight where it matters, comfortable where it counts.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          "When you buy from us, you get a relationship - not just a receipt."
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Timeline (horizontal) -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sand-deep); padding-top:40px; padding-bottom:48px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="justify-content:center; text-align:center; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; margin-bottom:28px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Our path here</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Three decades, four chapters</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="story-timeline" aria-label="Company history">
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">1996</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Doors open on the Sunshine Coast</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Two demo units, an old service ute, one rule: sell what we'd take camping ourselves.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2000s</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Kimberley Kampers partnership</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Shared values, quality you could feel in the chassis. The backbone of what we stock.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2010s</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Stockman joins the lineup</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Tough, lightweight, purpose-built. The right fit for families going further.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2026</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Thirty years, still going</h3>
          <p class="story-body">2,000+ YouTube subscribers, workshop running flat out, same plan as 1996.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why buy from us -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Why buy from us</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:28px;">What you get from us</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Shane doesn't sell what he hasn't used</h3>
          <p>Every model on the floor has been tested, walked through, and inspected. If we wouldn't take it out, you won't see it on the lot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Buy and service in one place</h3>
          <p>The workshop that preps your van is the same one that services it for the next 20 years. We know your rig because we built it for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>No rush to close the deal</h3>
          <p>We're not in a hurry to close a sale. We're in a hurry to make sure you walk out with the RIGHT van. Sometimes that means we tell you to wait.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Meet us on screen -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sand-deep);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:1080px;">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto 32px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Watch first</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Meet us on screen first</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">
          Get a feel for who we are and how we work before you drive out.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="video-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));">
        {meetVideos.map((v) => <VideoCard video={v} showCategory={false} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Get in touch -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:680px;">
      <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--tan-border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:32px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Get in touch</div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Inter Tight', sans-serif; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); margin:8px 0 14px;">
          Reserve a show slot or just say hello
        </h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:18px;">
          The best way to know if a caravan is right for you is to walk through it with
          someone who knows it inside and out. Call us, send an email, or book a time -
          we'll show you around. No pressure, no rush.
        </p>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap:14px; padding:20px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--tan-border); border-bottom:1px solid var(--tan-border); margin-bottom:24px;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.72rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:4px;">Phone</div>
            <a href="tel:0753707933" style="color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">(07) 5370 7933</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.72rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:4px;">Email</div>
            <a href="mailto:office@seqcampers.com.au" style="color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; word-break:break-word;">office@seqcampers.com.au</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.72rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:4px;">Where</div>
            <span style="color:var(--ink); font-weight:600;">Sunshine Coast, QLD</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/brisbane-show-2026" class="btn-primary">Reserve a show slot</a>
          <a href="/videos" class="btn-ghost" style="background:rgba(42,22,8,0.06); color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--tan-border);">Watch our videos</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
